>
> [...munch...]
>
> # C - Fatal Error : 424
> # couldn't open include file : stdio.h
> # File not found (OS error -43)
>  
> [...munch...]

The problem is simple: MPW can't find stdio.h, which is one of the
standard ANSI C header files (meaning your version of MPW is not ANSI C
compliant).  The Install docs say that you must have MPW C 3.2...do you?
 Anyway, get an ANSI C compliant compiler, and things will work *much*
better.

